From 9673e21cbb846620088f6c250a84a2bed173fe04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MicroNUX_Project <micronux@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 12:13:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] riscv: add MicroNUX per-mm user arenas

Replace the globally exposed reserved user pool with one contiguous arena
owned by each NOMMU mm. Suballocate mappings inside the arena. Zero pages
before publishing bounds. Release ownership only when the mm is destroyed.
This lets the user-return PMP overlay and access_ok use per-process bounds.

Signed-off-by: MicroNUX_Project <micronux@example.invalid>
